        "loc_myriad_beast_fusion_color_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration places Lu Tong Lan and Jiao Huo among the Eight Extremities, still superior to others as experts among rank sevens even while using totem killer moves inside Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven, so people gather around them. As Fire Blend Tribe Leader he taunts Lu Tong Lan, then leaves for a Yellow Bell Tribe banquet after an elder summons him, seeming to use his tribe’s weakness to get close to Yellow Bell Tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        2114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
